                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.00 Revolutions/129: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Porto Alegre</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Nasmith</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-10-20T14:00:00-05:00">October 20, 1930—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your October 17th, 4 p.m. On October 18th Secretary of State made statement in
                    his press conference such as you requested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
